  "body": "For more information, please download the files within the link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/ZMYF\r\n\r\nA large entertaining deck, beautifully landscaped gardens and a spacious, fully fenced lawn create a fantastic space for families, children and pets. Set in a quiet pocket of Ara Hills, this Stonewood-built weatherboard home offers privacy, sunshine and plenty of room to enjoy.\r\n\r\nLight-filled open plan living brings together a well-appointed kitchen with Bosch appliances, excellent storage and a handy scullery nook, with large stacker doors extending the living space onto the entertaining deck. A separate media room provides additional space for the family, while the upper level features spacious bedrooms, a dedicated study and a family bathroom. The sunny master bedroom includes a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, with heat pumps throughout the home adding year-round comfort. Surrounded by established hedging for privacy, there's plenty of room for outdoor dining and BBQs, while the generous lawn provides a fantastic space for kids and pets.\r\n\r\n* Light-filled open plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n* Separate media room and upstairs study\r\n* Stylish kitchen with Bosch appliances and scullery nook\r\n* Spacious master bedroom with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* Family bathroom with bath plus guest toilet downstairs\r\n* Large entertaining deck with outdoor dining and BBQ space\r\n* Fully fenced backyard with established hedging and landscaped gardens\r\n* Internal access garage with laundry and excellent storage\r\n* Built by Stonewood with balance of 10 Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nPositioned in Orewa's Ara Hills community, with a playground just around the corner, this is a fantastic opportunity for families wanting space, privacy and a backyard they can really enjoy. Equally appealing for those seeking a quality first home with easy-care living and room to grow.\r\n\r\nWe work with all agencies from day one!",
